    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d660">

                <pb facs="0664" n="594" xml:id="pg594"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.5151/430: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-10-01T17:00:00-05:00">October 1, 1934—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>141. Your telegram No. 238 of September 25, 3 p.m. Department is extremely
                    interested, and you may apprise the appropriate Brazilian authorities of its
                    interest, in the negotiations for a special exchange arrangement, which you
                    report Brazil contemplates making with Germany. Please keep the Department
                    promptly and fully informed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
